From: Manasi-ish <manasi2003patra@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:33:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] relink: WDF interface-property store (idx 50-52) + USB
 interface claim + GetModuleHandleW(NULL) fix + RegQueryInfoKey + build/size
 fixes

Generic relinker fixes that do not depend on a specific sensor:
- WDF 50/51/52 WdfDevice*InterfaceProperty implemented (keyed property store); stub idx 33.
  This is the wall that blocks the whole Synaptics Tudor family (see #20).
- Claim USB interfaces up-front (fixes capture: usbfs did not claim interface 0).
- GetModuleHandleW(NULL)/GetModuleHandleExW(FROM_ADDRESS) return current module.
- USER32/power/WTS/registry import stubs the driver needs for its notification path.
- Raise IPC record/message size caps for larger drivers.
- Build: -Wno-* flags for modern GCC; udev->libudev pkgconfig + udevdir default.
